        "magnitude": "Magnitude 2, Non-Variable, Area 10, Resist (Resilience)",
        "description": "This spell fills a volume 10 metres in radius with thick choking green gas. Any living creature that breathes oxygen who fails Resilience test takes 1D4 damage per round and is incapacitated due to heavy coughing. Next round make a Resilience test to see if they compose themselves enough to overcome the incapacitating coughing,.They still take 1D4 damage every round that they are in the cloud. The cloud also obscures vision, providing any creature within it with cover, so that ranged attackers are at two Penalty dice (-2P) to their attack roll and that any melee in the cloud is at a Penalty die (-1P)."
